<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>OP Gang Beasts Backflip.</Major>
    <Description>I made this Gang Beasts Macro myself because it was looking really empty.
This macro can be modified to your likings but this is the way it works best for me. Contact me if you find some delays that are better.

I have tried this myself and I myself is using this macro because its very easy. I might make other macros if I can find them.

You can backflip for fun or to KO your enemies. It can be a little tricky to learn how to KO them.
You can also press WASD keys to make yourself go in that direction while backflipping.

It is really powerful.</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 224 1
KeyDown 225 1
Delay 75 ms
KeyDown 16 1
KeyUp 224 1
Delay 250 ms
KeyDown 44 1
Delay 900 ms
KeyUp 44 1
Delay 1 ms
KeyUp 16 1
Delay 200 ms
KeyUp 225 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Gang Beasts</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>